# qq opens with no destination: Enter adds nothing until a project is chosen with /, then adds there.
file <<END
Work:
	- Email boss
Home:
	- Fix sink
END
keys qq
see Type the text
type Buy bulbs
keys <Enter>
see Choose a project with /
keys <Space> / ho <Enter>
see Quick Add → Home
keys <Enter>
status Added to Home
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Email boss
Home:
	- Fix sink
	- Buy bulbs
END
